      "id": "inline:in-the-cart-a-discounted-line-shows-the-struck-t-f06f32d7",
      "statement": "In the cart, a discounted line shows the struck-through MRP and a percent-off badge, and the cart's total saving is computed from mrp minus the charged price (not a hardcoded amount)",
